%N A217706 Decimal expansion of -Sum_{n>=2} (-1)^n*log(1 - 1/(n*(n-1))).
%H A217706 StackExchange, <a href="http://math.stackexchange.com/questions/69090/challenging-alternating-infinite-series-involving-ln">A challenging alternating infinite series involving ln</a>.
%e A217706 The sum (without the minus sign) is negative: -0.56655310975860303045313941015205379279725462723997096552170...
%t A217706 2*ArcCsch[2] + Log[2] + LogGamma[(3 - GoldenRatio)/2] + LogGamma[GoldenRatio/2] - LogGamma[1 - GoldenRatio/2] - LogGamma[(GoldenRatio - 1)/2] // RealDigits[#, 10, 100]& // First
%o A217706 (PARI) my(phi = quadgen(5)); -2*asinh(1/2) - log(2) - log(gamma((3 - phi)/2)) - log(gamma(phi/2)) + log(gamma(1 - phi/2)) + log(gamma((phi - 1)/2)) \\ _Amiram Eldar_, Nov 12 2026
